# Smoke test for the in-process MCU emulator
#
# Drives klippy in real-mcu mode against the test/emulator package:
# klippy connects to the emulator over a pty, exchanges identify+
# clocksync, finalizes config, and exercises the SHT3X i2c sensor with
# scripted responses. The fixture supplies CRC-correct bytes so the
# sensor reports valid temperatures.
#
# This test only runs when the host can compile klippy's chelper module
# (Linux today; the protocol code itself is OS-independent).
CONFIG emulator_smoke.cfg
DICTIONARY atmega2560.dict
EMULATOR emulator_smoke.fixture.json

# A few harmless gcode lines so klippy gets past klippy:ready.
M114
M105
M105
M105

# klippy connected and stayed connected long enough to do periodic
# sht3x reads against the scripted fixture.
EXPECT_LOG_CONTAINS "Loaded MCU 'mcu'"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Internal error"
EXPECT_LOG_NOT_CONTAINS "Klippy is shutdown"
